{"unit_id":"pyc123720__dsh-clarify#card-zh","repo":"pyc123720/dsh-clarify","commit":"ab4575687f6a3fb594ad9bc8ef4991f068f2eb6c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-clarify 是面向 DSH Web 的需求澄清插件：开启后，它通过系统提示引导 agent 先复述目标，再用逐题访谈收集会改变交付结果的信息，并在用户明确批准需求卡后才开始工作。它向 DSH 注册 clarify_ask 与 clarify_brief 工具、/clarify 命令和输入框访谈面板；每题支持选项与自定义回答，也可跳过或要求修改。需求卡可附待定事项和验收清单，批准后保存到本机并供后续会话参考。适合希望减少需求误解、返工并留存验收标准的 DSH 用户。无需 API Key 或外部账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:136","lib/index.js:306","lib/tools.js:390","lib/client.js:1","lib/card-file.js:90"]}
{"unit_id":"pyc123720__dsh-clarify#card-en","repo":"pyc123720/dsh-clarify","commit":"ab4575687f6a3fb594ad9bc8ef4991f068f2eb6c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-clarify helps DSH users clarify requirements before work. It adds interview and approval tools, a /clarify command, and a web panel with separate answer fields. Users approve a requirement card with a checklist; cards are saved locally. No API key is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:136","lib/index.js:306","lib/tools.js:390","lib/client.js:1","lib/card-file.js:90"]}
