{"unit_id":"pyc123720__dsh-clarify#feature-1","repo":"pyc123720/dsh-clarify","commit":"ab4575687f6a3fb594ad9bc8ef4991f068f2eb6c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-clarify 的功能「需求访谈面板」：调用 clarify_ask 后，输入框上方会显示逐题访谈；每题有独立选项和自定义输入，用户提交后答案返回给 agent。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1","lib/index.js:274"]}
